    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Solve\n$$\\frac{1}{|2x-1|}<2$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x<\\frac14$ or $x>\\frac34$.",
      "worked": "The expression is defined for $x\\ne\\frac12$. Both sides are positive, so reciprocating reverses the inequality:\n$$|2x-1|>\\frac12.$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}2x-1&>\\frac12&\\text{or}\\quad -2x+1&>\\frac12\\\\2x&>\\frac32&-2x&>-\\frac12\\\\x&>\\frac34&x&<\\frac14\\end{aligned}$$\nHence $x<\\frac14$ or $x>\\frac34$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 35
  },
